+const duration=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(out+'/session-duration.json','utf8'));
+const materials='逐条证据报告 evidence/review/rubric-comparison.txt；唯一截图 evidence/screenshots/01-rubric-comparison.png；代码与生命周期审计 evidence/review/code-audit.md；原专项和四类交错原始日志 evidence/review/runtime.log；真实 CLI 跨密钥 check/restore 与损坏 pack 拒绝日志 evidence/review/cli-final.log；审核测试通过 Go overlay 执行，未修改模型生产代码。预置离线材料 F:/swe/099934/authoring/offline-materials，301 项 SHA256 校验，空缓存、隔离公网、UID 65534；时长 evidence/review/session-duration.json；完整单次轨迹 evidence/trajectory.md；冻结 YAML 已实际解析 evidence/review/verify-rubric.yaml。';
